1
00:00:45,253 --> 00:00:48,965
PERFECT CROWN

2
00:00:54,216 --> 00:00:55,631
SPONSORED BY: MINISTRY OF
CULTURE, SPORTS AND TOURISM

3
00:00:55,712 --> 00:00:57,213
AND KOREA CREATIVE
CONTENT AGENCY.

4
00:00:57,536 --> 00:00:59,473
MBC DRAMA SCRIPT
CONTEST WINNER

5
00:00:59,851 --> 00:01:00,977
THIS IS A WORK OF FICTION

6
00:01:01,061 --> 00:01:02,979
CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS
WERE FILMED SAFELY

7
00:01:18,369 --> 00:01:20,205
You said you'd let me fly.

8
00:01:20,288 --> 00:01:21,706
Why are you the one flying?

9
00:01:23,416 --> 00:01:25,418
Let's switch. I can hold you.

10
00:01:26,169 --> 00:01:27,670
- Forget it.
- Why not? Come on…

11
00:01:51,903 --> 00:01:53,154
Your Royal Highness.

12
00:01:53,822 --> 00:01:55,281
Are you hurt anywhere?

13
00:02:02,205 --> 00:02:03,706
You said I can do whatever I want.

14
00:03:18,907 --> 00:03:23,912
PERFECT CROWN

15
00:03:24,495 --> 00:03:26,039
{\an8}EPISODE 7

16
00:03:40,637 --> 00:03:42,639
{\an8}- Your Ladyship!
- Your Royal Highness.

17
00:03:43,598 --> 00:03:46,935
{\an8}Why were you out so late
without the Royal Guard?

18
00:03:48,228 --> 00:03:50,355
{\an8}Well, we were… You know…

19
00:03:50,438 --> 00:03:53,316
They must have wanted some alone time.

20
00:03:55,109 --> 00:03:57,111
Did you go somewhere nice?

21
00:03:57,195 --> 00:03:58,613
- No!
- No!

22
00:04:04,744 --> 00:04:06,621
He wanted some fresh air,

23
00:04:07,705 --> 00:04:09,791
so we went for a drive. Beep-beep.

24
00:04:10,333 --> 00:04:12,669
Then you should've let us know!

25
00:04:12,752 --> 00:04:15,713
Aide Choi is a complete mess
because you two weren't reachable.

26
00:04:21,636 --> 00:04:22,637
Listen.

27
00:04:23,763 --> 00:04:25,056
- You should…
- Pardon?

28
00:04:25,139 --> 00:04:26,975
- What? Huh?
- Yes?

29
00:04:31,729 --> 00:04:33,022
You should get some rest.

30
00:04:34,399 --> 00:04:35,692
Aren't you tired?

31
00:04:37,110 --> 00:04:38,444
I am.

32
00:04:40,280 --> 00:04:41,698
Gosh, I'm so tired.

33
00:05:27,660 --> 00:05:29,662
I mean, it's no big deal.

34
00:05:29,746 --> 00:05:31,914
We were just caught up in the moment.

35
00:05:31,998 --> 00:05:33,291
I mean, it's not like

36
00:05:33,875 --> 00:05:35,043
I threw myself at him.

37
00:05:35,835 --> 00:05:36,836
Hmm.

38
00:05:44,802 --> 00:05:46,554
Why did I do that?

39
00:06:33,518 --> 00:06:34,644
It's fine.

40
00:06:34,727 --> 00:06:36,687
You're a grown,
functioning member of society.

41
00:06:38,106 --> 00:06:39,941
It's not fine at all!

42
00:06:40,024 --> 00:06:42,944
I'm so screwed. What am I going to do now?

43
00:06:54,664 --> 00:06:55,665
Seong Huiju.

44
00:06:58,126 --> 00:06:59,168
What now?

45
00:07:36,038 --> 00:07:37,957
Are you nuts? Why are you racing?

46
00:07:55,183 --> 00:07:56,184
What are you doing?

47
00:08:19,457 --> 00:08:20,583
Off to work already?

48
00:08:24,212 --> 00:08:25,046
Oh!

49
00:08:25,129 --> 00:08:27,048
Yes, that's right.

50
00:08:27,131 --> 00:08:29,383
I need to get to work.

51
00:08:29,467 --> 00:08:31,802
I need to work. I'm the CEO.

52
00:08:31,886 --> 00:08:34,764
Need to figure out my successor and all.
This and that.

53
00:08:35,598 --> 00:08:37,099
What a lovely day it is today.

54
00:08:37,183 --> 00:08:38,267
See you.

55
00:09:01,165 --> 00:09:04,877
In the name of the Father,
the Son, and the Holy Spirit,

56
00:09:04,961 --> 00:09:06,087
Amen.

57
00:09:06,671 --> 00:09:07,672
Amen.

58
00:09:10,049 --> 00:09:11,050
You see,

59
00:09:11,926 --> 00:09:14,679
I'm actually not Catholic. Is that okay?

60
00:09:15,555 --> 00:09:18,057
Well, the man upstairs is a forgiving one.

61
00:09:18,641 --> 00:09:19,642
Please go ahead.

62
00:09:21,644 --> 00:09:23,229
Then, by chance,

63
00:09:23,312 --> 00:09:25,356
do you think I could get an exorcism?

64
00:09:25,439 --> 00:09:26,357
Pardon me?

65
00:09:27,733 --> 00:09:28,734
It's just that…

66
00:09:29,485 --> 00:09:31,529
I feel like I'm possessed right now.

67
00:09:38,077 --> 00:09:39,328
Oh no!

68
00:09:40,496 --> 00:09:42,915
Could we maybe work something out?

69
00:09:42,999 --> 00:09:45,751
I can make a very generous donation
to the church.

70
00:09:52,049 --> 00:09:53,050
Seriously?

71
00:09:53,551 --> 00:09:55,094
"Not one to begrudge"?

72
00:09:55,177 --> 00:09:57,096
Yet he just did that.

73
00:09:57,597 --> 00:09:59,098
I even wore white for this.

74
00:10:01,642 --> 00:10:02,560
Seong Huiju?

75
00:10:02,643 --> 00:10:04,103
Oh.

76
00:10:04,186 --> 00:10:05,271
Jeongwoo.

77
00:10:06,981 --> 00:10:08,107
What brings you here?

78
00:10:09,275 --> 00:10:10,276
Oh, a cab.

79
00:10:12,069 --> 00:10:14,530
That's not what I'm asking.
Why are you here?

80
00:10:15,573 --> 00:10:17,199
I thought you weren't religious.

81
00:10:19,076 --> 00:10:20,119
I know, right?

82
00:10:23,456 --> 00:10:24,832
Wait here. I'll be right out.

83
00:10:25,625 --> 00:10:26,876
No, I can just go

84
00:10:27,501 --> 00:10:28,502
by myself…

85
00:10:36,927 --> 00:10:38,638
PRINCE

86
00:10:45,978 --> 00:10:46,979
Yes, Your Royal Highness.

87
00:10:47,063 --> 00:10:48,522
Are you free?

88
00:10:49,649 --> 00:10:50,650
Right now?

89
00:10:50,733 --> 00:10:53,194
We have something on the calendar
for wedding planning,

90
00:10:53,277 --> 00:10:54,737
but you said you were busy.

91
00:10:54,820 --> 00:10:55,821
<i>I see.</i>

92
00:10:56,906 --> 00:10:57,907
Shall I reschedule it?

93
00:10:57,990 --> 00:10:59,283
No, I have time.

94
00:10:59,367 --> 00:11:01,077
Let's go, Huiju.

95
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:02,411
That was quick.

96
00:11:06,749 --> 00:11:09,502
Your Royal Highness, I'll call you later.

97
00:11:10,795 --> 00:11:11,796
See you later.

98
00:11:14,256 --> 00:11:16,926
JUNIOR ALUM

99
00:11:19,261 --> 00:11:20,638
Shall we?

100
00:11:24,141 --> 00:11:25,309
I'm coming.

101
00:11:37,196 --> 00:11:38,698
I told you,
I could've taken a cab.

102
00:11:40,074 --> 00:11:41,701
It's fine. It's on the way anyway.

103
00:11:47,832 --> 00:11:49,291
Do you like driving too?

104
00:11:50,292 --> 00:11:51,752
- That's random.
- The Grand Prince

105
00:11:51,836 --> 00:11:53,254
smiles when he drives too.

106
00:11:53,921 --> 00:11:55,256
He says it feels like he's flying.

107
00:11:57,925 --> 00:11:59,927
He can be so childlike sometimes.

108
00:12:12,273 --> 00:12:15,860
{\an8}CASTLE BEAUTY

109
00:12:15,943 --> 00:12:17,361
Bye. Thanks for the ride.

110
00:12:18,487 --> 00:12:19,989
- Huiju.
- Yes?

111
00:12:21,073 --> 00:12:22,491
Don't get too attached.

112
00:12:23,993 --> 00:12:25,161
What?

113
00:12:25,786 --> 00:12:27,580
It'll drive up the divorce settlement.

114
00:12:28,289 --> 00:12:29,874
Be it in money, reputation…

115
00:12:31,834 --> 00:12:32,835
or your heart.

116
00:12:40,593 --> 00:12:42,470
Do you think I'm an idiot?

117
00:12:45,014 --> 00:12:46,015
Bye.

118
00:13:08,621 --> 00:13:10,289
Who does he take me for?

119
00:13:10,790 --> 00:13:12,958
Someone who can't distinguish
between business and pleasure?

120
00:13:13,042 --> 00:13:14,043
Seriously?

121
00:13:17,505 --> 00:13:18,506
Ms. Seong.

122
00:13:18,589 --> 00:13:21,175
Pull the affiliate numbers
and line them up by revenue.

123
00:13:22,259 --> 00:13:23,260
Throw this out for me.

124
00:13:30,267 --> 00:13:31,602
Why, all of a sudden?

125
00:13:32,186 --> 00:13:34,355
They must all be thrilled
that I'm stepping down.

126
00:13:34,855 --> 00:13:37,566
Planning to slack off
without the revenue-obsessed boss

127
00:13:37,650 --> 00:13:38,859
breathing down their necks.

128
00:13:39,735 --> 00:13:41,529
So you want to whip them into shape?

129
00:13:41,612 --> 00:13:42,863
Yes.

130
00:13:44,448 --> 00:13:47,785
I'll remind them they'll be
royally screwed if revenue drops.

131
00:13:51,747 --> 00:13:53,290
Okay, I'll get to it now.

132
00:13:53,374 --> 00:13:54,834
Have Seong Taeju meet me there.

133
00:13:54,917 --> 00:13:56,293
The Senior Managing Director?

134
00:13:59,880 --> 00:14:02,174
{\an8}AUSPICIOUS DATES
FOR GRAND PRINCE I-AN'S WEDDING

135
00:14:04,051 --> 00:14:06,512
These are the dates
the Royal Secretariat and the Cabinet

136
00:14:06,595 --> 00:14:08,556
have proposed
for the Grand Prince's nuptials.

137
00:14:09,306 --> 00:14:10,432
All are auspicious days,

138
00:14:10,516 --> 00:14:13,477
so Your Majesty may select
whichever you see fit.

139
00:14:18,858 --> 00:14:21,735
Your Majesty,
Grand Prince I-AN has arrived.

140
00:14:21,819 --> 00:14:23,529
Show him in.

141
00:14:31,620 --> 00:14:32,621
Your Majesty.

142
00:14:34,790 --> 00:14:37,126
I heard you were selecting
the day for my nuptials.

143
00:14:38,711 --> 00:14:40,546
I am considering choosing this date.

144
00:14:41,046 --> 00:14:42,089
Is there a particular reason?

145
00:14:42,172 --> 00:14:44,633
Is it not the earliest day?

146
00:14:47,177 --> 00:14:48,512
May I take a look?

147
00:14:59,857 --> 00:15:01,775
I would prefer this day.

148
00:15:03,027 --> 00:15:04,612
For any particular reason?

149
00:15:06,655 --> 00:15:07,656
We will need…

150
00:15:09,742 --> 00:15:10,826
some time.

151
00:15:13,579 --> 00:15:15,205
I shall choose this date then.

152
00:15:18,918 --> 00:15:21,879
JULY 3RD, LUNAR JUNE 9TH

153
00:15:26,592 --> 00:15:28,344
I'm just here to support the team.

154
00:15:28,427 --> 00:15:30,387
No need to be nervous.

155
00:15:31,639 --> 00:15:35,309
You are our top-performing affiliate
in terms of sales.

156
00:15:36,852 --> 00:15:38,270
The new collection that just launched

157
00:15:38,354 --> 00:15:41,106
is performing well
with the 25-35 demographic.

158
00:15:41,690 --> 00:15:44,693
This necklace is part of
the same set as your earrings today.

159
00:15:44,777 --> 00:15:46,195
Would you like to try it on?

160
00:15:46,779 --> 00:15:47,780
- Sure.
- All right.

161
00:15:57,039 --> 00:15:58,165
Hmm…

162
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:03,796
And it'll stay that way, right?

163
00:16:04,630 --> 00:16:05,631
Pardon?

164
00:16:05,714 --> 00:16:07,257
I don't think I'll ever stop

165
00:16:08,550 --> 00:16:09,969
being curious about numbers.

166
00:16:13,263 --> 00:16:15,265
I might be getting married,

167
00:16:15,808 --> 00:16:18,477
but I'll still be keeping an eye
and ear on things.

168
00:16:19,645 --> 00:16:21,730
Of course, ma'am.
We'll continue doing our best.

169
00:16:23,774 --> 00:16:25,401
Huiju.

170
00:16:29,571 --> 00:16:31,490
Did I ask you to invite that gremlin too?

171
00:16:31,573 --> 00:16:32,866
It wasn't me.

172
00:16:37,496 --> 00:16:39,540
I insisted on coming along.

173
00:16:39,623 --> 00:16:41,333
I missed you, you know.

174
00:16:41,417 --> 00:16:43,877
You could've just called
if you had something to say.

175
00:16:43,961 --> 00:16:45,671
Making me come all this way…

176
00:16:45,754 --> 00:16:48,424
Babe, check this out.
This would look perfect on you.

177
00:16:49,091 --> 00:16:51,218
Come on. This new collection is nice.

178
00:16:51,301 --> 00:16:52,511
Try this on.

179
00:16:53,595 --> 00:16:54,555
It's… Whoa, amazing.

180
00:16:54,638 --> 00:16:56,181
This will be the first handover.

181
00:16:56,265 --> 00:16:57,766
What?

182
00:16:58,684 --> 00:17:00,060
My shares.

183
00:17:01,770 --> 00:17:02,771
Right, your shares…

184
00:17:04,023 --> 00:17:05,149
What?

185
00:17:05,899 --> 00:17:06,900
Wait.

186
00:17:08,527 --> 00:17:10,029
You mean it?

187
00:17:10,112 --> 00:17:12,614
You're really going to hand it over
to me? All of Castle Beauty?

188
00:17:12,698 --> 00:17:14,616
- Should I not?
- You should.

189
00:17:15,451 --> 00:17:17,953
Come on. Why would you say such a thing?

190
00:17:18,037 --> 00:17:20,539
- I will kill you if you fail.
- What?

191
00:17:22,291 --> 00:17:23,917
You heard me.

192
00:17:24,001 --> 00:17:25,669
I will kill you.

193
00:17:34,928 --> 00:17:37,973
Is that brat setting a trap to murder me?

194
00:17:38,891 --> 00:17:39,892
No.

195
00:17:40,726 --> 00:17:41,602
No?

196
00:17:41,685 --> 00:17:43,687
Yeah, definitely not.

197
00:17:49,401 --> 00:17:50,527
Did you really mean that?

198
00:17:51,445 --> 00:17:52,446
What?

199
00:17:52,529 --> 00:17:55,282
You have other options,
like hiring a non-owner executive.

200
00:17:55,365 --> 00:17:56,658
There's also Director Choi.

201
00:17:56,742 --> 00:17:58,077
It sounds like

202
00:17:58,869 --> 00:18:01,080
you never want me to come back.

203
00:18:02,539 --> 00:18:06,043
- What?
- Father and everyone will finally get it

204
00:18:06,126 --> 00:18:08,337
once Seong Taeju takes over.

205
00:18:08,420 --> 00:18:09,880
"Oh, right.

206
00:18:09,963 --> 00:18:13,175
Seong Huiju is leagues above Seong Taeju.

207
00:18:13,884 --> 00:18:16,261
Thus, the Castle Group successor must be

208
00:18:16,345 --> 00:18:19,389
Seong Huiju and no one else."

209
00:18:19,473 --> 00:18:20,766
I see.

210
00:18:20,849 --> 00:18:22,434
Which affiliate is next?

211
00:18:27,940 --> 00:18:29,483
Since when were they an affiliate?

212
00:18:30,734 --> 00:18:33,987
I was told you confirmed it.
Were they wrong?

213
00:18:34,071 --> 00:18:35,114
When?

214
00:18:35,197 --> 00:18:36,573
- This morning.
- When did I…

215
00:18:36,657 --> 00:18:38,325
<i>- Are you free?
- I have time.</i>

216
00:18:38,408 --> 00:18:39,409
I did that.

217
00:18:40,577 --> 00:18:41,870
I most certainly did.

218
00:18:41,954 --> 00:18:43,163
Seriously?

219
00:18:43,247 --> 00:18:44,248
Let's go.

220
00:18:51,713 --> 00:18:52,714
What the…

221
00:18:53,465 --> 00:18:54,591
You're unbelievable.

222
00:19:19,324 --> 00:19:20,325
How pretty.

223
00:19:21,285 --> 00:19:23,579
This will be your wedding robe,

224
00:19:23,662 --> 00:19:26,248
so please let us know right away
if you feel any discomfort.

225
00:19:26,331 --> 00:19:27,875
- Sure.
- Please take your place.

226
00:19:32,087 --> 00:19:33,338
Ms. Do.

227
00:20:20,052 --> 00:20:21,762
- Can you turn to the right?
- Sure.

228
00:20:33,148 --> 00:20:34,149
Hmm?

229
00:20:35,025 --> 00:20:36,026
Oh!

230
00:20:36,109 --> 00:20:37,486
What's wrong?

231
00:20:38,570 --> 00:20:39,571
Stay still.

232
00:21:01,593 --> 00:21:03,262
- Are you feeling unwell?
- What?

233
00:21:03,345 --> 00:21:04,721
- Are you sick?
- Royal Physician!

234
00:21:04,805 --> 00:21:06,098
- What's wrong?
- No, I'm fine.

235
00:21:06,181 --> 00:21:08,100
- Oh!
- What is it?

236
00:21:08,183 --> 00:21:10,352
No, I'm just feeling
a little hot. That's all.

237
00:21:10,435 --> 00:21:12,562
No, I think you have a fever.

238
00:21:12,646 --> 00:21:14,731
I'm just a little hot. Too many layers.

239
00:21:14,815 --> 00:21:16,608
Her Ladyship is overheated.
Lower the room temperature.

240
00:21:16,692 --> 00:21:17,901
Yes, ma'am.

241
00:21:17,985 --> 00:21:19,569
- Please hurry.
- No, I…

242
00:21:19,653 --> 00:21:21,071
It will be cooler in no time.

243
00:21:22,072 --> 00:21:24,032
Isn't it time for our next appointment?

244
00:21:24,116 --> 00:21:25,158
Your next appointment?

245
00:21:25,242 --> 00:21:28,036
After this, a royal physician
will come by for a health assessment.

246
00:21:28,120 --> 00:21:30,289
Tomorrow, we have dinner
at Ms. Seong's family home.

247
00:21:30,372 --> 00:21:32,291
What? "Family home"?

248
00:21:33,166 --> 00:21:35,752
As in <i>my </i>family? Why?

249
00:21:36,336 --> 00:21:39,756
It's customary for a future son-in-law
to offer his greetings to his in-laws.

250
00:21:43,093 --> 00:21:44,094
Mmm.

251
00:21:44,720 --> 00:21:47,514
Ah. The chairman's office was notified.

252
00:21:47,597 --> 00:21:49,016
They already confirmed it.

253
00:21:49,099 --> 00:21:50,225
Thank you.

254
00:21:50,309 --> 00:21:53,437
I'm off to handle the Marriage Proposal
and Wedding Gift Delivery ceremonies.

255
00:21:53,937 --> 00:21:55,647
Marriage Proposal ceremony?

256
00:21:56,231 --> 00:21:59,693
Marriage Proposal
and Wedding Gift Delivery ceremonies?

257
00:22:20,464 --> 00:22:23,133
"This is a royal edict
for Hyeonguk of the Seong Family.

258
00:22:23,759 --> 00:22:24,801
The King proclaimed…"

259
00:22:24,885 --> 00:22:26,928
"When Heaven and Earth first parted,

260
00:22:27,012 --> 00:22:28,722
human order came into being.

261
00:22:28,805 --> 00:22:32,351
Through the union of husband and wife,
the ancestors and royal line are upheld."

262
00:22:42,444 --> 00:22:44,029
Hand me another piece of paper.

263
00:22:44,112 --> 00:22:45,155
Yes, Your Majesty.

264
00:22:51,953 --> 00:22:53,705
<i>In accordance with tradition,</i>

265
00:22:53,789 --> 00:22:57,167
<i>Chief Attendant Min Jeongwoo
and Deputy Attendant Choi Hyeon</i>

266
00:22:57,250 --> 00:23:00,337
<i>shall observe proper decorum
and carry out the Marriage Proposal.</i>

267
00:23:00,420 --> 00:23:03,382
"Thus is the royal edict.
Let all be duly informed."

268
00:23:25,112 --> 00:23:27,322
I will now outline the proceedings.

269
00:23:27,823 --> 00:23:29,157
Traditionally, the wedding rites

270
00:23:29,241 --> 00:23:32,077
begin at the bride's home.

271
00:23:32,160 --> 00:23:34,246
However, given the security risks

272
00:23:34,329 --> 00:23:36,706
and His Royal Highness's regency,
they will instead be held

273
00:23:36,790 --> 00:23:38,250
at his private residence.

274
00:23:39,126 --> 00:23:41,420
Then we'll be
at his private residence as well?

275
00:23:41,503 --> 00:23:43,422
Yes, that's right.

276
00:23:44,256 --> 00:23:47,008
And I also have this for you…

277
00:23:47,092 --> 00:23:49,094
Just a moment.

278
00:23:50,804 --> 00:23:54,141
I put together an outline
of the wedding rites, just in case.

279
00:23:54,224 --> 00:23:55,725
Can you

280
00:23:55,809 --> 00:23:57,310
speak a bit faster?

281
00:23:59,312 --> 00:24:02,023
- Pardon?
- I had to postpone two meetings for this.

282
00:24:03,024 --> 00:24:05,110
Yes, sir. Here you go.

283
00:24:08,822 --> 00:24:10,824
FATHER

284
00:24:13,201 --> 00:24:14,244
Ms. Seong.

285
00:24:15,036 --> 00:24:16,037
Hey.

286
00:24:16,121 --> 00:24:17,664
They're all waiting for you.

287
00:24:19,916 --> 00:24:21,209
Why have you stepped outside?

288
00:24:23,670 --> 00:24:24,671
Are you still overheated?

289
00:24:25,589 --> 00:24:27,340
No, it's not that.

290
00:24:27,424 --> 00:24:30,385
Then you must return
for your health assessment.

291
00:24:32,012 --> 00:24:33,054
Okay.

292
00:24:35,891 --> 00:24:37,267
You will have

293
00:24:37,350 --> 00:24:39,519
a more thorough exam
at Royal Seoul Hospital.

294
00:24:40,187 --> 00:24:43,023
Today's examination will assess
constitution and fertility.

295
00:24:43,106 --> 00:24:44,441
Pardon?

296
00:24:44,524 --> 00:24:45,817
Yes?

297
00:24:48,403 --> 00:24:51,740
Mmm… No, it's nothing. Please continue.

298
00:24:51,823 --> 00:24:55,410
Heirs are precious within the palace.

299
00:24:55,494 --> 00:24:58,872
Once your health is duly confirmed,
arrangements for your union shall...

300
00:24:58,955 --> 00:25:00,207
"Arrangements"?

301
00:25:02,000 --> 00:25:03,877
What sort of arrangements?

302
00:25:04,836 --> 00:25:08,465
The conjugal union symbolizes
the harmony of yin and yang.

303
00:25:08,548 --> 00:25:12,511
Yin must flow to yang,
and yang must incline toward yin.

304
00:25:12,594 --> 00:25:14,387
Once proper comportment facilitates that,

305
00:25:14,471 --> 00:25:16,223
an auspicious day and hour shall be set…

306
00:25:16,306 --> 00:25:18,016
- Hold on.
- What is it?

307
00:25:18,600 --> 00:25:20,519
Her pulse is elevated.

308
00:25:21,102 --> 00:25:22,103
Uh…

309
00:25:22,187 --> 00:25:23,980
Are you feeling unwell?

310
00:25:24,064 --> 00:25:25,232
Wait, hold on.

311
00:25:25,315 --> 00:25:27,317
Could this be
a post-accident complication?

312
00:25:27,400 --> 00:25:31,029
No, it's nothing like that. Be quiet.

313
00:25:31,112 --> 00:25:33,365
Then do you have a preexisting condition?

314
00:25:33,448 --> 00:25:36,618
No, not at all.
No preexisting condition.

315
00:25:36,701 --> 00:25:38,036
That is enough.

316
00:25:38,119 --> 00:25:39,829
I wish to speak with her in private.

317
00:25:40,622 --> 00:25:41,623
Give us the room.

318
00:25:42,541 --> 00:25:44,125
Yes, Your Royal Highness.

319
00:25:56,513 --> 00:25:57,722
Something bothering you?

320
00:25:58,348 --> 00:25:59,349
What?

321
00:26:00,642 --> 00:26:02,185
You've been acting strangely.

322
00:26:02,269 --> 00:26:03,478
What do you mean?

323
00:26:07,232 --> 00:26:09,192
You're the one
who's been acting strangely.

324
00:26:10,151 --> 00:26:12,737
- Me?
- You're being unnecessarily sweet to me.

325
00:26:13,446 --> 00:26:15,824
While everyone was watching,

326
00:26:15,907 --> 00:26:17,492
you, like, brushed
the hair out of my face.

327
00:26:17,576 --> 00:26:19,244
And your eyes…

328
00:26:22,497 --> 00:26:26,293
You keep looking at me
with those doe eyes.

329
00:26:26,376 --> 00:26:27,752
My eyes have never changed.

330
00:26:27,836 --> 00:26:28,753
That's not true.

331
00:26:34,050 --> 00:26:35,051
Is this about yesterday?

332
00:26:42,809 --> 00:26:44,060
I'm fine.

333
00:26:44,728 --> 00:26:45,895
About what?

334
00:26:45,979 --> 00:26:46,980
About last night.

335
00:26:48,982 --> 00:26:49,983
I'm fine with it.

336
00:26:51,109 --> 00:26:53,278
It's not like we're kids or anything.

337
00:26:53,778 --> 00:26:55,155
I mean, if the vibe is right…

338
00:26:56,156 --> 00:26:57,532
Why not?

339
00:26:58,116 --> 00:27:00,285
And with the vibe we had going yesterday,

340
00:27:00,368 --> 00:27:02,370
even if it had been a complete stranger,

341
00:27:03,163 --> 00:27:05,457
anyone would've done the same. Yeah…

342
00:27:10,545 --> 00:27:11,588
A complete stranger…

343
00:27:13,548 --> 00:27:14,549
Pardon?

344
00:27:14,633 --> 00:27:15,967
Not for me.

345
00:27:19,763 --> 00:27:20,764
What?

346
00:27:22,223 --> 00:27:23,308
What does that mean?

347
00:27:24,392 --> 00:27:27,228
I didn't do it just because
I was caught up in the moment.

348
00:27:30,899 --> 00:27:31,900
I did it…

349
00:27:34,361 --> 00:27:35,779
because it's you.

350
00:27:50,502 --> 00:27:52,379
The Grand Prince is perturbed?

351
00:27:52,921 --> 00:27:54,047
Yes, Your Majesty.

352
00:27:54,130 --> 00:27:56,383
Ms. Seong was by earlier in the day.

353
00:27:56,883 --> 00:27:58,718
He has been a bit agitated ever since.

354
00:28:02,430 --> 00:28:05,642
The date has been set,
yet he remains agitated…

355
00:28:09,938 --> 00:28:11,731
I shall go for a walk with him.

356
00:28:18,822 --> 00:28:20,865
Did something happen to upset you?

357
00:28:25,829 --> 00:28:27,372
You appear troubled.

358
00:28:29,541 --> 00:28:32,335
Could you be upset
about what happened yesterday evening?

359
00:28:34,212 --> 00:28:35,296
Of course not.

360
00:28:37,006 --> 00:28:38,007
Then,

361
00:28:39,259 --> 00:28:41,720
did you have an argument with Ms. Seong?

362
00:28:44,180 --> 00:28:45,890
It seems you wish that to be so.

363
00:28:49,269 --> 00:28:51,062
I am merely worried.

364
00:28:52,105 --> 00:28:54,566
You two come from different worlds.

365
00:28:55,233 --> 00:28:57,444
Perfect accord cannot be easily attained.

366
00:29:02,407 --> 00:29:03,408
And you?

367
00:29:04,743 --> 00:29:06,202
Did you attain accord?

368
00:29:10,123 --> 00:29:11,291
You and my brother

369
00:29:12,208 --> 00:29:14,419
grew up in the same world.

370
00:29:18,590 --> 00:29:19,591
Did you two…

371
00:29:21,718 --> 00:29:22,969
arrive at happiness?

372
00:29:27,682 --> 00:29:29,559
How can I go by myself?

373
00:29:31,019 --> 00:29:32,812
They are expecting both of us.

374
00:29:32,896 --> 00:29:34,230
What would you have me do?

375
00:29:37,317 --> 00:29:38,318
Your Majesty.

376
00:29:46,785 --> 00:29:48,244
Has my brother run off again?

377
00:29:54,542 --> 00:29:55,752
I shall accompany you.

378
00:29:57,629 --> 00:29:59,839
If we say that the Crown Prince is unwell,

379
00:30:00,465 --> 00:30:03,426
they would scarcely consider it
improper that I, the Grand Prince,

380
00:30:04,093 --> 00:30:05,470
accompany you in his stead.

381
00:30:08,097 --> 00:30:10,058
That would only prompt Father
to reprimand you.

382
00:30:11,392 --> 00:30:13,728
I'm reprimanded every day anyway.

383
00:30:33,790 --> 00:30:35,583
Is there any place

384
00:30:36,751 --> 00:30:38,962
for happiness in a royal union?

385
00:30:57,146 --> 00:30:58,147
<i>I did it</i>

386
00:30:59,274 --> 00:31:00,483
because it's you.

387
00:31:19,878 --> 00:31:23,381
PRINCE

388
00:31:26,050 --> 00:31:27,051
No.

389
00:31:27,552 --> 00:31:29,178
So what?

390
00:31:29,262 --> 00:31:30,638
Should we just date a little

391
00:31:31,681 --> 00:31:33,266
since we're going to divorce anyway?

392
00:31:36,019 --> 00:31:37,020
Nope.

393
00:32:00,543 --> 00:32:03,004
MARRIAGE CONTRACT

394
00:32:05,757 --> 00:32:08,801
4. DIVORCE WITHIN THREE YEARS
AT THE LATEST

395
00:32:32,575 --> 00:32:33,952
You must hurry.

396
00:32:59,811 --> 00:33:01,604
Why are you in such a state?

397
00:33:06,859 --> 00:33:08,653
Please get up, Your Majesty.

398
00:33:15,451 --> 00:33:16,452
Your Majesty?

399
00:33:24,043 --> 00:33:25,044
The press

400
00:33:26,212 --> 00:33:29,007
will soon spread the news
of His Majesty's tragedy.

401
00:33:30,383 --> 00:33:33,803
You must secure
the Crown Prince's accession.

402
00:33:33,886 --> 00:33:36,139
His Majesty had abandoned
the Crown Prince.

403
00:33:40,601 --> 00:33:42,520
He wished to depose the Crown Prince…

404
00:33:45,982 --> 00:33:48,443
and abdicate
in favor of Grand Prince I-AN.

405
00:33:49,610 --> 00:33:50,611
What do you mean?

406
00:33:50,695 --> 00:33:53,156
He even drew up a royal edict!

407
00:34:02,957 --> 00:34:04,000
I am certain…

408
00:34:07,378 --> 00:34:09,047
His Majesty will understand me.

409
00:34:12,633 --> 00:34:14,552
This was all for the Crown Prince's sake.

410
00:34:17,889 --> 00:34:18,890
What in the world

411
00:34:20,308 --> 00:34:22,185
have you done?

412
00:34:25,063 --> 00:34:26,064
I…

413
00:34:31,778 --> 00:34:34,030
I burned it all to the ground.

414
00:35:46,602 --> 00:35:49,188
AS SUCH, I INTEND TO ABDICATE

415
00:35:49,272 --> 00:35:51,941
AND BE SUCCEEDED
BY GRAND PRINCE I-AN

416
00:36:04,620 --> 00:36:07,832
"I am most pleased to see you again,
Your Royal Highness." And then…

417
00:36:07,915 --> 00:36:09,625
"It is my great honor."

418
00:36:10,501 --> 00:36:12,128
- Damn it…
- Babe.

419
00:36:12,211 --> 00:36:13,796
Did you not dry your hair?

420
00:36:13,880 --> 00:36:16,674
I tried doing it like His Royal Highness.
Do you not like it?

421
00:36:16,757 --> 00:36:19,635
Why would you copy his style?

422
00:36:19,719 --> 00:36:22,305
Too many feelers? I just thought…

423
00:36:22,388 --> 00:36:25,099
You're so much more handsome than him!

424
00:36:25,600 --> 00:36:27,018
- Really?
- Who does Taeju belong to?

425
00:36:27,101 --> 00:36:29,520
To Dayeong. Ah…

426
00:36:30,396 --> 00:36:32,690
- Stop it. Come on.
- Why isn't Father coming down?

427
00:36:34,650 --> 00:36:37,236
But what if Father
does a repeat of yesterday?

428
00:36:37,320 --> 00:36:38,487
He wouldn't.

429
00:36:38,571 --> 00:36:40,239
Father? Father!

430
00:36:40,323 --> 00:36:41,782
I can hear you perfectly fine.

431
00:36:43,284 --> 00:36:45,036
Father.

432
00:36:46,287 --> 00:36:49,373
You should lighten up a little.
We should be celebrating today.

433
00:36:49,457 --> 00:36:51,209
- Smile.
- That's right.

434
00:36:51,292 --> 00:36:53,586
You can hate your own kid,
but you shouldn't hate your son-in-law.

435
00:36:53,669 --> 00:36:55,379
Especially, when he's Grand Prince I-AN.

436
00:36:55,463 --> 00:36:56,464
Just look at me.

437
00:36:56,547 --> 00:36:59,926
After falling for Dayeong,
I bow down to her father like it's my job.

438
00:37:00,009 --> 00:37:02,136
Do you see how Grand Prince I-AN
is wasting no time?

439
00:37:02,220 --> 00:37:04,055
He must be beyond smitten
with her too. I swear...

440
00:37:04,138 --> 00:37:05,723
That's enough of that nonsense.

441
00:37:30,665 --> 00:37:33,292
If I could just have
your attention for a moment.

442
00:37:33,376 --> 00:37:36,796
Once we arrive, there might be a bit
of a crowd waiting to see you two.

443
00:37:36,879 --> 00:37:39,632
Please remember to smile
when you step out.

444
00:37:39,715 --> 00:37:43,010
Ms. Seong, you can just follow
the Grand Prince's lead and wave.

445
00:37:49,016 --> 00:37:50,017
And the Royal Guard?

446
00:37:50,101 --> 00:37:52,687
We should be fine.
We dispatched double the normal amount.

447
00:37:53,771 --> 00:37:54,981
- What about…
- What about…

448
00:38:01,237 --> 00:38:03,197
Do we have an end time?

449
00:38:03,281 --> 00:38:05,908
There's no rush.
You should just enjoy your meal,

450
00:38:05,992 --> 00:38:08,202
but at the minimum,
we're thinking four hours…

451
00:38:08,286 --> 00:38:09,328
Four hours?

452
00:38:09,412 --> 00:38:10,913
Well, you see,

453
00:38:10,997 --> 00:38:13,541
if you leave too early,
it may be seen as discourteous.

454
00:38:13,624 --> 00:38:17,128
If too late, the other members
of the royal family will grow jealous.

455
00:38:17,211 --> 00:38:20,381
I'd appreciate it if you
kept these things in mind.

456
00:38:37,315 --> 00:38:39,191
Please forgive the delayed greetings.

457
00:38:40,526 --> 00:38:41,527
Father.

458
00:38:44,071 --> 00:38:47,783
Well,
we are very honored to host you,

459
00:38:47,867 --> 00:38:49,660
Your Royal Highness.

460
00:38:50,244 --> 00:38:53,039
My dear younger sister is not perforated.
I mean, not perfect.

461
00:38:53,122 --> 00:38:55,833
We hope she does not prove an impediment.

462
00:38:56,584 --> 00:38:57,710
And…

463
00:38:59,712 --> 00:39:01,213
I, Hyeonguk of the Seong Family,

464
00:39:01,839 --> 00:39:03,841
offer you my greetings,
Your Royal Highness.

465
00:39:08,346 --> 00:39:09,555
This is my son.

466
00:39:09,638 --> 00:39:11,891
I'm the Senior Managing Director
of Castle Group

467
00:39:11,974 --> 00:39:13,726
and his soon-to-be successor…

468
00:39:15,061 --> 00:39:16,103
Yes, right.

469
00:39:16,854 --> 00:39:18,981
I remember, Brother.

470
00:39:20,608 --> 00:39:22,610
Yes, I see.

471
00:39:22,693 --> 00:39:24,487
Uh…

472
00:39:24,570 --> 00:39:25,780
"Brother"? Insane.

473
00:39:25,863 --> 00:39:27,573
You mean, "Your Royal Highness."

474
00:39:28,157 --> 00:39:33,079
Yes, right. He already… Yeah.

475
00:39:44,048 --> 00:39:46,634
I mean, I know it's just an…

476
00:39:48,969 --> 00:39:50,304
just an act and all,

477
00:39:50,388 --> 00:39:52,681
but they're so stiff
around each other, aren't they?

478
00:39:52,765 --> 00:39:54,850
I'm so scared they're going to get caught.

479
00:39:54,934 --> 00:39:56,185
I hear you.

480
00:39:56,268 --> 00:39:59,480
I heard it was super awkward
during the health assessment yesterday.

481
00:39:59,563 --> 00:40:01,982
I mean, can you imagine
how tense she must've been?

482
00:40:02,066 --> 00:40:05,111
To make her heart pound like that?

483
00:40:05,194 --> 00:40:06,237
But…

484
00:40:07,446 --> 00:40:09,573
- Don't you think it's excessive?
- My thoughts exactly.

485
00:40:09,657 --> 00:40:11,867
- Maybe they're falling for each other.
- What?

486
00:40:11,951 --> 00:40:14,787
I mean, they actually look like
they just started dating.

487
00:40:16,038 --> 00:40:17,206
Just started dating…

488
00:40:18,249 --> 00:40:19,458
Oh?

489
00:40:22,753 --> 00:40:24,588
I need to go.

490
00:40:24,672 --> 00:40:25,840
I'll come with you.

491
00:40:26,340 --> 00:40:28,968
No, you should finish all this first.

492
00:40:30,219 --> 00:40:31,220
I'm off.

493
00:40:32,054 --> 00:40:33,639
Okay. See you later.

494
00:41:08,048 --> 00:41:09,300
Yes, thanks.

495
00:41:10,009 --> 00:41:11,760
Thank you.

496
00:41:11,844 --> 00:41:14,388
I'm actually the CEO
of Castle Hotel as well.

497
00:41:14,472 --> 00:41:17,600
I had some of our chefs come by
to cook this. How is it?

498
00:41:17,683 --> 00:41:19,685
You're not the CEO yet.

499
00:41:19,768 --> 00:41:21,812
That handover hasn't happened yet.

500
00:41:21,896 --> 00:41:23,355
Must you bring that up now?

501
00:41:23,898 --> 00:41:25,900
It's almost done.

502
00:41:27,193 --> 00:41:29,069
It's all very good, Brother.

503
00:41:29,153 --> 00:41:30,404
Oh…

504
00:41:30,488 --> 00:41:31,489
Is it?

505
00:41:32,031 --> 00:41:34,116
I'm so glad.

506
00:41:34,200 --> 00:41:39,038
Can I ask when you two started dating?

507
00:41:40,164 --> 00:41:41,165
- Pardon?
- Well, you see,

508
00:41:41,248 --> 00:41:43,792
she used to have terrible taste in men.

509
00:41:43,876 --> 00:41:46,545
What do they call it?
You know, the ones you carry around.

510
00:41:46,629 --> 00:41:48,756
Who cares about that now?

511
00:41:48,839 --> 00:41:50,591
Oh, right. Trophy boys.

512
00:41:50,674 --> 00:41:53,886
She used to be really into trophy boys.
They were always so skinny.

513
00:41:53,969 --> 00:41:56,180
But somehow, she landed
a really solid husband.

514
00:41:56,263 --> 00:41:58,224
Seong…

515
00:41:58,849 --> 00:41:59,850
Dear brother.

516
00:42:01,143 --> 00:42:02,937
Relax. It's a compliment.

517
00:42:03,020 --> 00:42:04,313
Just look at Our Royal Highness.

518
00:42:04,396 --> 00:42:07,441
He's so tall. Almost as tall
as the doorframe. And his shoulders…

519
00:42:07,525 --> 00:42:09,527
Yeah, they're almost
as broad as this table.

520
00:42:09,610 --> 00:42:12,154
That's a real man for you…

521
00:42:12,238 --> 00:42:16,408
He's just trying to say
that you make a really nice couple.

522
00:42:16,492 --> 00:42:17,618
Yeah, that's right.

523
00:42:18,244 --> 00:42:19,578
- Stop drinking.
- Okay.

524
00:42:20,746 --> 00:42:23,040
Yeah, a nice couple. Mmm…

525
00:42:23,123 --> 00:42:24,708
Please…

526
00:42:25,793 --> 00:42:27,336
cherish her.

527
00:42:31,173 --> 00:42:33,759
She spent her whole life
thinking highly of herself,

528
00:42:33,842 --> 00:42:34,843
so I had hoped

529
00:42:36,303 --> 00:42:38,264
she'd end up with someone
a bit beneath her.

530
00:42:38,347 --> 00:42:41,433
I cannot help but be concerned
about her marrying into the royal family.

531
00:42:41,517 --> 00:42:44,019
I will do my best to make sure
you have nothing to worry...

532
00:42:44,103 --> 00:42:46,313
If that was all it took,
I would not worry.

533
00:42:54,405 --> 00:42:55,406
That place is known

534
00:42:56,198 --> 00:42:58,701
for its troubles and tragedies, is it not?

535
00:43:11,589 --> 00:43:12,590
That doesn't

536
00:43:13,215 --> 00:43:14,216
quite hold up, does it?

537
00:43:16,218 --> 00:43:17,803
Who are you trying to kid?

538
00:43:20,055 --> 00:43:22,057
Am I wrong?

539
00:43:22,141 --> 00:43:24,476
Where was that ever-worried father

540
00:43:24,560 --> 00:43:27,646
when I got into that car accident?

541
00:43:29,523 --> 00:43:31,108
It just doesn't add up, does it?

542
00:43:32,735 --> 00:43:35,529
As you can see, she is still a child.

543
00:43:36,864 --> 00:43:38,532
She has her shortcomings...

544
00:43:38,616 --> 00:43:40,618
That's enough small talk, isn't it?

545
00:43:41,327 --> 00:43:43,120
Don't you have a wedding gift for us?

546
00:43:43,829 --> 00:43:45,539
I mean, when Taeju got married,

547
00:43:46,206 --> 00:43:49,376
you gave Dayeong's family
company shares and even a building.

548
00:43:49,460 --> 00:43:50,669
All on a silver platter.

549
00:43:57,009 --> 00:43:59,094
Your one and only daughter
is getting married.

550
00:44:00,262 --> 00:44:01,805
Surely, you must have something.

551
00:44:03,849 --> 00:44:04,892
How about

552
00:44:05,934 --> 00:44:07,770
a generous donation to the crown?

553
00:44:07,853 --> 00:44:08,937
Hey.

554
00:44:09,521 --> 00:44:11,440
You're making
His Royal Highness uncomfortable.

555
00:44:15,194 --> 00:44:18,155
You can finish this meal without me.

556
00:44:18,238 --> 00:44:20,115
I thought I could practice restraint…

557
00:44:22,701 --> 00:44:23,827
…but it's just too hard.

558
00:44:33,504 --> 00:44:34,963
Hmm…

559
00:44:39,635 --> 00:44:40,969
Let me check on her.

560
00:45:08,622 --> 00:45:09,623
Seong Huiju.

561
00:45:35,858 --> 00:45:37,359
Just let me be for a second.

562
00:45:38,193 --> 00:45:40,821
I'll come back down
once my anger subsides a bit.

563
00:45:54,001 --> 00:45:55,002
What?

564
00:45:56,879 --> 00:46:00,007
Are you having second thoughts?
Because my family is such a hot mess?

565
00:46:03,927 --> 00:46:05,220
You must have a bad memory.

566
00:46:08,557 --> 00:46:10,392
If you remembered
what Queen Mother said to me,

567
00:46:11,101 --> 00:46:12,519
there's no way you'd say that.

568
00:46:16,940 --> 00:46:17,941
That's true.

569
00:46:21,069 --> 00:46:23,697
Doesn't it seem like your father likes me?

570
00:46:27,284 --> 00:46:29,119
- You believed that?
- Should I not?

571
00:46:29,745 --> 00:46:32,623
That doting, concerned father bit
is all an act.

572
00:46:33,499 --> 00:46:36,251
The result of him running
the numbers and sizing up

573
00:46:37,169 --> 00:46:38,837
what he could gain by using you.

574
00:46:51,183 --> 00:46:52,184
Who cares?

575
00:46:53,352 --> 00:46:54,436
As long as I'm genuine.

576
00:46:58,398 --> 00:47:00,359
I have a great deal that you do not,

577
00:47:01,235 --> 00:47:02,444
and if you ask for it,

578
00:47:03,862 --> 00:47:05,447
I fully intend to provide it.

579
00:47:20,712 --> 00:47:21,713
By chance,

580
00:47:23,382 --> 00:47:25,050
do you have feelings for me?

581
00:47:26,760 --> 00:47:29,137
- All of a sudden?
- Then was I

582
00:47:30,222 --> 00:47:33,141
your first… or something?

583
00:47:34,226 --> 00:47:35,310
What?

584
00:47:35,394 --> 00:47:36,979
I mean…

585
00:47:38,063 --> 00:47:41,900
It's true. I can be quite a femme fatale.

586
00:47:43,569 --> 00:47:44,778
But still,

587
00:47:46,238 --> 00:47:48,198
your eyes are sparkling a little too much.

588
00:48:04,590 --> 00:48:05,716
I do like you.

589
00:48:07,217 --> 00:48:08,343
And it's my first time.

590
00:48:13,473 --> 00:48:15,267
Restraint always followed desire.

591
00:48:17,686 --> 00:48:18,979
But it's not easy this time.

592
00:48:24,443 --> 00:48:26,653
What? Having second thoughts?

593
00:48:28,238 --> 00:48:29,823
Worried I won't divorce you?

594
00:48:32,826 --> 00:48:33,827
You won't?

595
00:48:39,666 --> 00:48:40,667
Don't worry.

596
00:48:41,960 --> 00:48:43,670
I don't want to keep you bound to me.

597
00:48:48,800 --> 00:48:50,218
You should just accept it all.

598
00:48:51,803 --> 00:48:53,347
Whether it be money, honor,

599
00:48:55,057 --> 00:48:56,141
or my heart…

600
00:49:12,032 --> 00:49:13,951
I've always had more money than you.

601
00:49:15,327 --> 00:49:16,370
Always?

602
00:49:16,453 --> 00:49:17,871
Always have.

603
00:49:17,955 --> 00:49:19,206
- "Always have"?
- Always will.

604
00:50:20,392 --> 00:50:21,768
JEONGWOO

605
00:50:25,564 --> 00:50:26,648
What? Pick it up.

606
00:50:32,821 --> 00:50:34,156
Hey, Jeongwoo.

607
00:50:34,948 --> 00:50:37,784
Yeah, it's over. We're heading back
to the private residence.

608
00:50:40,203 --> 00:50:42,456
Yeah, he's right next to me.

609
00:50:43,081 --> 00:50:44,332
Sure. Hold on.

610
00:50:48,837 --> 00:50:50,881
<i>Your Royal Highness,
did it go well?</i>

611
00:50:50,964 --> 00:50:52,090
Yeah.

612
00:50:52,174 --> 00:50:54,551
My father-in-law loves me.

613
00:50:54,634 --> 00:50:56,303
<i>Really?</i>

614
00:50:57,095 --> 00:50:58,805
<i>I guess you didn't fight
with your father today.</i>

615
00:50:58,889 --> 00:51:01,600
Do you think I just go around
starting fights everywhere?

616
00:51:03,018 --> 00:51:04,770
<i>And Taeju? Did he behave?</i>

617
00:51:09,608 --> 00:51:10,609
He was whatever.

618
00:51:11,610 --> 00:51:15,238
I still can't tell if handing over
the reins to him was a good idea.

619
00:51:16,907 --> 00:51:17,949
Yeah.

620
00:51:19,868 --> 00:51:20,952
I know, right?

621
00:51:22,329 --> 00:51:24,372
What about you? Are you done with work?

622
00:51:34,508 --> 00:51:35,967
I'll see you on our wedding day.

623
00:51:42,015 --> 00:51:43,225
I'm sad about leaving too.

624
00:52:15,340 --> 00:52:16,508
How did it go?

625
00:52:16,591 --> 00:52:17,801
Did the chairman like him?

626
00:52:17,884 --> 00:52:22,472
- Of course, he did. How could he not?
- Earlier, His Royal Highness was like,

627
00:52:22,556 --> 00:52:23,682
"I'm sad about leaving too."

628
00:52:24,850 --> 00:52:26,726
He said that before he left.

629
00:52:26,810 --> 00:52:28,603
Was His Royal Highness nervous?
Did he do well?

630
00:52:28,687 --> 00:52:30,897
Have you been waiting for me
to ask about that?

631
00:52:31,565 --> 00:52:33,400
- Yes.
- They couldn't even eat.

632
00:52:33,483 --> 00:52:34,651
They were all so nervous.

633
00:52:34,734 --> 00:52:36,736
- Still?
- Yes.

634
00:52:38,280 --> 00:52:40,240
I know it's late,

635
00:52:41,241 --> 00:52:42,242
but should we grab a bite?

636
00:52:42,325 --> 00:52:44,202
- Yes.
- Yes please!

637
00:52:44,286 --> 00:52:45,745
What about that new place?

638
00:52:45,829 --> 00:52:47,998
You said that place was delicious.

639
00:52:48,081 --> 00:52:50,292
- Where is this place?
- Yeah, we should go there.

640
00:52:55,422 --> 00:52:56,756
Enjoy.

641
00:52:56,840 --> 00:52:59,301
Thank you. All right, then.

642
00:52:59,384 --> 00:53:00,802
Eat up now.

643
00:53:00,886 --> 00:53:02,637
It'll all be

644
00:53:03,305 --> 00:53:04,556
my treat tonight.

645
00:53:04,639 --> 00:53:07,142
- Thank you.
- Thank you so much.

646
00:53:10,979 --> 00:53:12,314
Mmm!

647
00:53:12,397 --> 00:53:13,899
It's so good.

648
00:53:13,982 --> 00:53:15,859
Your Ladyship, you should have some too.

649
00:53:15,942 --> 00:53:16,943
Poor thing.

650
00:53:17,027 --> 00:53:19,571
You must've been too nervous to eat.

651
00:53:21,031 --> 00:53:23,992
You must be a ball of nerves
with the wedding approaching.

652
00:53:24,075 --> 00:53:28,246
Come on, a lot of people go on diets
before their wedding.

653
00:53:28,330 --> 00:53:29,414
As if.

654
00:53:29,497 --> 00:53:33,293
She's already light as a feather.
Why would she go on a diet?

655
00:53:33,376 --> 00:53:37,172
I'm taking
a night off from that diet.

656
00:53:37,255 --> 00:53:38,298
- Eat up.
- Excellent.

657
00:53:40,717 --> 00:53:41,718
Mmm…

658
00:53:42,427 --> 00:53:43,428
Mmm!

659
00:53:43,511 --> 00:53:47,474
We've been meaning to throw you
a little bridal shower.

660
00:53:47,557 --> 00:53:49,392
Maybe we can pick up a cake later?

661
00:53:49,476 --> 00:53:52,145
Her Ladyship must be tired.
Just eat up.

662
00:53:55,190 --> 00:53:56,566
Areum, why aren't you eating?

663
00:53:56,650 --> 00:53:58,526
I thought you liked this place.

664
00:53:58,610 --> 00:54:01,696
Ah… I'm just taking my time.
You should eat up too.

665
00:54:03,782 --> 00:54:05,200
- Hmm…
- Here, eat this.

666
00:54:07,994 --> 00:54:09,079
It's good.

667
00:54:22,259 --> 00:54:24,094
This is the Treasury's revised proposal.

668
00:54:24,177 --> 00:54:25,720
Please take a look.

669
00:54:30,850 --> 00:54:33,353
<i>Sir,
His Royal Highness is here for you.</i>

670
00:54:35,272 --> 00:54:36,606
He is?

671
00:54:36,690 --> 00:54:38,275
It's not on your schedule.

672
00:54:47,659 --> 00:54:48,660
You busy?

673
00:54:59,462 --> 00:55:00,547
Can I get you anything?

674
00:55:02,590 --> 00:55:03,800
I like Seong Huiju.

675
00:55:07,345 --> 00:55:08,722
I thought you should know.

676
00:55:15,020 --> 00:55:16,104
And does my knowing that

677
00:55:16,771 --> 00:55:17,772
change anything?

678
00:55:19,024 --> 00:55:20,066
It'll make sure

679
00:55:21,526 --> 00:55:22,861
you mind your conduct.

680
00:55:35,373 --> 00:55:37,500
Does Huiju know too?

681
00:55:42,005 --> 00:55:43,882
I'm talking about myself right now.

682
00:55:45,133 --> 00:55:46,176
Not her.

683
00:55:46,718 --> 00:55:47,969
Don't make…

684
00:55:50,180 --> 00:55:51,639
things difficult for Huiju.

685
00:55:52,724 --> 00:55:53,725
What?

686
00:55:53,808 --> 00:55:55,393
That's not

687
00:55:56,770 --> 00:55:57,979
what she wants from you.

688
00:56:14,746 --> 00:56:15,747
Where's Seong Huiju?

689
00:56:15,830 --> 00:56:18,291
Ah… She went into a board meeting
two hours ago.

690
00:56:18,375 --> 00:56:19,793
She should be done by now.

691
00:56:21,294 --> 00:56:22,670
She's probably in transit now.

692
00:56:22,754 --> 00:56:25,465
She said she was visiting an affiliate
right after the meeting.

693
00:56:26,424 --> 00:56:29,219
- She'll have no time to eat.
- Exactly.

694
00:56:29,302 --> 00:56:32,055
Her shares and duties must be transferred
before the wedding.

695
00:56:32,138 --> 00:56:34,265
She has so much on her plate.

696
00:56:34,349 --> 00:56:37,310
Meaning poor Ms. Do
must also be suffering…

697
00:56:39,938 --> 00:56:41,147
Thanks for your hard work.

698
00:56:47,362 --> 00:56:49,322
DON'T FORGET TO EAT…

699
00:56:58,164 --> 00:56:59,833
She's everywhere.

700
00:57:04,379 --> 00:57:07,006
- Why are they taking that down?
- Pardon?

701
00:57:07,090 --> 00:57:09,134
Oh, that? It needs to be taken down now.

702
00:57:09,217 --> 00:57:11,594
Her Royal Highness cannot engage
in personal promotion.

703
00:57:19,936 --> 00:57:22,522
{\an8}<i>Don't forget to eat
just because you're busy.</i>

704
00:57:22,605 --> 00:57:25,733
<i>Why'd you pull that ad already?
Make money while you still can.</i>

705
00:57:27,402 --> 00:57:28,862
- Ms. Seong.
- What?

706
00:57:33,867 --> 00:57:35,201
- Continue.
- Yes, ma'am.

707
00:57:35,827 --> 00:57:37,662
Next, we are developing plans

708
00:57:37,745 --> 00:57:39,956
for local marketing campaigns
and influencer partnerships,

709
00:57:40,039 --> 00:57:42,625
along with a training program
for the new product launch.

710
00:57:42,709 --> 00:57:45,044
We're in the final review stage
of the contracts.

711
00:57:46,045 --> 00:57:48,214
Okay. Sounds good.

712
00:57:59,309 --> 00:58:00,310
<i>Your Royal Highness.</i>

713
00:58:01,311 --> 00:58:03,980
The ceremonial robe has arrived
from the Royal Tailor Institution.

714
00:58:21,164 --> 00:58:22,499
Are you that delighted?

715
00:58:25,210 --> 00:58:26,252
No.

716
00:58:28,963 --> 00:58:30,590
- Where's Huiju?
- Ms. Seong is...

717
00:58:30,673 --> 00:58:31,716
Your Royal Highness.

718
00:58:32,383 --> 00:58:35,512
You must now observe
the proper forms of address.

719
00:58:39,724 --> 00:58:42,477
Where… is my wife?

720
00:58:46,606 --> 00:58:47,774
What is she doing?

721
00:58:57,951 --> 00:59:01,454
Your Ladyship!

722
00:59:06,584 --> 00:59:07,585
Right.

723
00:59:10,588 --> 00:59:11,589
Okay.

724
00:59:11,673 --> 00:59:14,175
So once you put on
that crimson ceremonial robe…

725
00:59:14,259 --> 00:59:17,595
- Crimson?
- Your eyeliner will smudge.

726
00:59:18,763 --> 00:59:22,016
I finally get to wear red
and walk into the palace?

727
00:59:22,100 --> 00:59:23,810
Here. The Ministry of Rites…

728
00:59:23,893 --> 00:59:25,144
Huiju!

729
00:59:26,104 --> 00:59:27,355
My goodness.

730
00:59:27,855 --> 00:59:30,858
Why are you here so early?

731
00:59:31,734 --> 00:59:36,406
You and your assistant have little regard
for court or noble etiquette.

732
00:59:36,489 --> 00:59:39,534
As a lady of a noble house,
I'll have to review everything myself.

733
00:59:49,836 --> 00:59:51,713
Mmm… Not bad.

734
00:59:54,257 --> 00:59:57,093
- Have her wedding shoes arrived?
- Yes, they have!

735
01:00:04,559 --> 01:00:06,269
- My goodness!
- Oh, my!

736
01:00:06,352 --> 01:00:08,813
This is how
you protect your heels.

737
01:00:08,896 --> 01:00:10,648
You'll be wearing them all day.

738
01:00:10,732 --> 01:00:12,900
I see. That makes sense.

739
01:00:13,526 --> 01:00:15,236
Hmm?

740
01:00:18,114 --> 01:00:19,115
Hey, Jeongwoo.

741
01:00:19,699 --> 01:00:20,950
Are preparations going well?

742
01:00:21,534 --> 01:00:23,077
You sure you don't want to call it off?

743
01:00:24,245 --> 01:00:26,789
And if I say I do, would you help me?

744
01:00:30,752 --> 01:00:31,753
Prime Minister Min.

745
01:00:33,379 --> 01:00:34,380
I'll call you back.

746
01:00:43,598 --> 01:00:45,433
Are you still not dressed?

747
01:00:47,310 --> 01:00:49,062
Are you all right?

748
01:00:51,522 --> 01:00:53,483
Why would I not be?

749
01:00:56,611 --> 01:00:57,612
Then…

750
01:00:59,656 --> 01:01:00,823
I shall wait.

751
01:01:05,578 --> 01:01:08,206
Until the day you can
no longer restrain yourself.

752
01:01:22,387 --> 01:01:24,555
Do we just wait here?

753
01:01:37,318 --> 01:01:39,237
Huiju looks so pretty.

754
01:01:40,863 --> 01:01:42,407
No, you're way prettier.

755
01:01:53,543 --> 01:01:55,670
Congratulations on your nuptials.

756
01:01:55,753 --> 01:01:57,630
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

757
01:02:06,973 --> 01:02:10,184
You're officially
the Grand Prince's wife.

758
01:02:10,268 --> 01:02:12,353
So? You like it?

759
01:02:24,198 --> 01:02:25,783
All bow deeply!

760
01:02:47,054 --> 01:02:48,264
All rise!

761
01:03:01,444 --> 01:03:02,862
- You're okay.
- Your Ladyship.

762
01:03:02,945 --> 01:03:03,946
Damn it…

763
01:03:10,328 --> 01:03:14,665
The bride and groom
shall exchange deep bows.

764
01:03:18,711 --> 01:03:21,047
By sharing this wine,

765
01:03:21,589 --> 01:03:23,800
you are now equals in status and soul.

766
01:03:25,384 --> 01:03:29,472
I proclaim to Heaven and Earth
that you are joined as husband and wife.

767
01:03:36,145 --> 01:03:37,230
Are you all right?

768
01:03:39,106 --> 01:03:40,107
I'm fine.

769
01:03:42,527 --> 01:03:47,698
The father of the bride
shall now offer words of caution.

770
01:03:50,284 --> 01:03:52,078
Show caution and reverence.

771
01:03:52,161 --> 01:03:54,580
From early dawn until late at night,

772
01:03:54,664 --> 01:03:56,874
let there be no deviation from command.

773
01:03:58,292 --> 01:03:59,293
Yes.

774
01:03:59,919 --> 01:04:01,838
I shall carry out your command faithfully.

775
01:04:03,548 --> 01:04:04,590
Do not look down.

776
01:04:05,424 --> 01:04:06,467
It makes you look weak.

777
01:05:04,317 --> 01:05:06,152
My goodness! Her Ladyship looks so…

778
01:05:06,235 --> 01:05:08,863
No, I mean, Her Royal Highness.

779
01:05:08,946 --> 01:05:10,907
Her lips must be on the verge of spasming.

780
01:05:10,990 --> 01:05:12,450
Just look at that perfect makeup.

781
01:05:12,533 --> 01:05:14,952
Aren't you glad I used pink coral
instead of coral pink?

782
01:05:15,036 --> 01:05:16,037
Totally.

783
01:05:16,120 --> 01:05:18,539
Just look at that massive crowd.

784
01:05:18,623 --> 01:05:20,833
I don't think it was that big
for the Queen Mother.

785
01:05:20,917 --> 01:05:22,209
Definitely not.

786
01:05:23,169 --> 01:05:26,756
Gosh. Why am I tearing up?

787
01:05:26,839 --> 01:05:29,342
You look like your son's getting married.

788
01:05:30,801 --> 01:05:33,220
Steward Kim, are you crying?

789
01:05:36,682 --> 01:05:39,393
Our Royal Highness is all grown up now.

790
01:05:40,436 --> 01:05:42,104
- Hey, we crushed that.
- Gosh.

791
01:05:42,188 --> 01:05:43,314
We crushed it!

792
01:05:55,701 --> 01:05:56,827
Smile.

793
01:05:56,911 --> 01:05:59,830
My jaw is about to snap
from all this smiling.

794
01:06:01,248 --> 01:06:04,210
How do you do this for every single event?

795
01:06:05,419 --> 01:06:06,462
Just hang in there.

796
01:06:07,964 --> 01:06:08,965
We're almost there.

797
01:06:25,439 --> 01:06:27,775
THE MARRIAGE PROCESSION OF
GRAND PRINCE I-AN

798
01:06:27,858 --> 01:06:29,694
AND GRAND PRINCESS SEONG

799
01:06:51,590 --> 01:06:54,010
That is why I told you to veto it.

800
01:06:56,220 --> 01:06:57,680
What is long suppressed

801
01:06:59,015 --> 01:07:01,017
tends to erupt
in the most unexpected ways.

802
01:07:21,245 --> 01:07:22,705
