829
01:11:35,958 --> 01:11:38,294
<i>Toxicity? Me?</i>

830
01:11:38,377 --> 01:11:39,962
<i>It looks deliberate.</i>

831
01:11:40,671 --> 01:11:43,048
I knew you would fail to protect her.

832
01:11:43,132 --> 01:11:44,633
<i>I made a mistake.</i>

833
01:11:44,717 --> 01:11:46,260
What are you doing? Calm down!

834
01:11:46,343 --> 01:11:48,637
He's in danger right now!

835
01:11:48,721 --> 01:11:50,723
<i>Was I being too greedy again?</i>

836
01:11:52,057 --> 01:11:53,600
<i>You're okay, right?</i>

837
01:11:53,684 --> 01:11:54,935
{\an8}<i>I thought you were dying.</i>

838
01:11:55,602 --> 01:11:56,937
{\an8}<i>I thought I lost you.</i>

839
01:11:57,438 --> 01:11:58,939
{\an8}What are you doing?

840
01:11:59,023 --> 01:12:01,775
{\an8}<i>The whole country saw me collapse live.</i>

841
01:12:01,859 --> 01:12:03,944
{\an8}<i>I can't be this pretty
when I'm discharged.</i>

842
01:12:04,778 --> 01:12:06,989
{\an8}<i>It's our first night
as a married couple.</i>

843
01:12:07,614 --> 01:12:08,657
{\an8}<i>Are you ready?</i>

844
01:12:14,288 --> 01:12:15,831
{\an8}EPILOGUE

845
01:12:15,914 --> 01:12:16,915
{\an8}Don't make…

846
01:12:19,251 --> 01:12:20,753
{\an8}things difficult for Huiju.

847
01:12:21,837 --> 01:12:22,838
{\an8}What?

848
01:12:22,921 --> 01:12:24,548
{\an8}That's not

849
01:12:25,883 --> 01:12:27,009
{\an8}what she wants from you.

850
01:12:38,896 --> 01:12:40,272
{\an8}Then why wasn't it you?

851
01:12:43,776 --> 01:12:45,903
{\an8}What she aims to gain through marrying me.

852
01:12:47,279 --> 01:12:48,655
{\an8}You could provide the same.

853
01:12:54,953 --> 01:12:56,538
{\an8}Perhaps I have something

854
01:12:57,664 --> 01:12:58,707
{\an8}she wants

855
01:13:00,292 --> 01:13:01,293
{\an8}that you don't have?

856
01:13:15,391 --> 01:13:17,393
{\an8}Translated by Justin S. Kim

857
01:13:28,695 --> 01:13:32,408
PERFECT CROWN
